        1106,
        1126
      ],
      "start": 718.37,
      "end": 727.57
    },
    {
      "en": "Today we have Norman Bridwell to talk with NPR's reporter on his dog's fiftieth birthday.",
      "asr_range": [
        1126,
        1141
      ],
      "start": 727.81,
      "end": 734.93
    },
    {
      "en": "So, Norman, tell us how it all started.",
      "asr_range": [
        1141,
        1149
      ],
      "start": 735.53,
      "end": 738.73
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, it was nineteen sixty two, and I was a struggling, not very successful artist in New York.",
      "asr_range": [
        1149,
        1167
      ],
      "start": 739.37,
      "end": 745.53
    },
    {
      "en": "My wife suggested that I try my hand at painting for children's books.",
      "asr_range": [
        1167,
        1180
      ],
      "start": 745.77,
      "end": 749.77
    },
    {
      "en": "So I did ten paintings and took them to publishers.",
      "asr_range": [
        1180,
        1190
      ],
      "start": 750.47,
      "end": 753.43
    },
    {
      "en": "I was turned down everywhere, except at one publisher, where a young woman told me I wasn't very good, so, if I wanted to paint for a book, I'd need to write one on my own.",
      "asr_range": [
        1190,
        1226
      ],
      "start": 753.67,
      "end": 764.23
    },
    {
      "en": "So you did.",
      "asr_range": [
        1226,
        1229
      ],
      "start": 764.92,
      "end": 765.8
    },
    {
      "en": "Um, the woman pointed to a painting I'd done of a little girl with a big red dog, and she said, “Maybe that's a story.”",
      "asr_range": [
        1229,
        1254
      ],
      "start": 766.36,
      "end": 774.76
    },
    {
      "en": "And I went home, and over that weekend I wrote the story Clifford the Big Red Dog.",
      "asr_range": [
        1254,
        1271
      ],
      "start": 775.0,
      "end": 780.36
    },
    {
      "en": "And was shocked when it was accepted for publication, because I'd never written anything before.",
      "asr_range": [
        1271,
        1286
      ],
      "start": 780.9,
      "end": 786.1
    },
    {
      "en": "I see.",
      "asr_range": [
        1286,
        1288
      ],
      "start": 786.66,
      "end": 787.54
    },
    {
      "en": "How wonderful! Yes, it was.",
      "asr_range": [
        1288,
        1293
      ],
      "start": 787.78,
      "end": 790.18
    },
    {
      "en": "My wife was also in shock when she did realize it wasn't a dream.",
      "asr_range": [
        1293,
        1307
      ],
      "start": 790.42,
      "end": 794.26
    },
    {
      "en": "But it was just luck.",
