      ],
      "start": 892.01,
      "end": 901.93
    },
    {
      "en": "Hello, everyone. Today I am going to talk about small talk, that is, short conversations people often have with strangers they meet.",
      "asr_range": [
        1582,
        1605
      ],
      "start": 963.45,
      "end": 972.97
    },
    {
      "en": "Such exchanges occur at bus stops, on buses, while waiting in line, almost anywhere that strangers gather close together.",
      "asr_range": [
        1605,
        1624
      ],
      "start": 973.21,
      "end": 981.45
    },
    {
      "en": "As a matter of fact, these short conversations are a good way for people to say hello and express friendliness.",
      "asr_range": [
        1624,
        1644
      ],
      "start": 982.19,
      "end": 989.23
    },
    {
      "en": "Such conversations usually cover a wide range of topics.",
      "asr_range": [
        1644,
        1653
      ],
      "start": 989.47,
      "end": 993.23
    },
    {
      "en": "The topics may include weather, customer service, movies, TV shows, local sports, or latest news.",
      "asr_range": [
        1653,
        1669
      ],
      "start": 993.47,
      "end": 1001.23
    },
    {
      "en": "But you should always keep it in your mind that private questions about salaries, family life, religious beliefs, and politics should be avoided during these conversations.",
      "asr_range": [
        1669,
        1695
      ],
      "start": 1001.92,
      "end": 1011.92
    },
    {
      "en": "Besides, it's better to ask open-ended questions.",
      "asr_range": [
        1695,
        1703
      ],
      "start": 1012.16,
      "end": 1014.96
    },
    {
      "en": "If you ask visitors, “Do you like our city?”",
      "asr_range": [
        1703,
        1712
      ],
      "start": 1015.56,
      "end": 1018.44
    },
    {
      "en": "They may say simply, “Yes.”",
      "asr_range": [
        1712,
        1717
      ],
      "start": 1018.68,
      "end": 1020.76
    },
    {
      "en": "On the other hand, if you ask, “What do you think of our city?”",
      "asr_range": [
        1717,
        1731
      ],
      "start": 1021.32,
      "end": 1024.92
    },
    {
      "en": "they will have more freedom in answering.",
      "asr_range": [
        1731,
        1738
      ],
      "start": 1025.32,
      "end": 1027.4
    },
    {
      "en": "This type of question also shows that you are interested in them.",
      "asr_range": [
        1738,
        1750
      ],
      "start": 1028.16,
      "end": 1032.24
    },
    {
      "en": "If you appear interested in what people are saying, they feel more comfortable talking with you.",
      "asr_range": [
        1750,
        1766
      ],
      "start": 1032.48,
      "end": 1038.4
    },
    {
      "en": "Hello, everyone.",
